## 📌 About the Internship

The internship focused on building a strong practical foundation in **Data Science, Data Engineering, Machine Learning, Data Preparation, Model Deployment, and Enterprise AI Platform Administration** using the **RapidMiner** platform. It followed a structured, week-wise curriculum combining conceptual learning, hands-on modules, weekly assessments, project documentation, and a Final Credential Validation / Internship Grade Point Assessment.

**Organization:** EduSkills Foundation (ISO 9001:2015 & ISO/IEC 20000-1:2018 certified) — runs the AICTE–EduSkills Virtual Internship Program under the patronage of the **AICTE National Internship Portal**, in collaboration with **Siemens Industry Software (India) Pvt. Ltd.**

---

## 🎯 Objectives

- Identify business problems suitable for AI and machine learning
- Access, load, transform, and calculate data using data engineering practices
- Build foundational and advanced machine learning models
- Master advanced data handling and automation techniques for data preparation
- Deploy and monitor machine learning models in practical use cases
- Configure and manage the RapidMiner AI Hub platform
- Understand enterprise-level platform administration and operations
- Complete weekly assessments and the Final Credential Validation / Internship Grade Point Assessment

